(SkillCatalog "Image generation: generate-image prompt, generate-image-quality prompt. Natural topics: imagegen, draw, make-image, generate-picture, picture, art.")
(SkillHelp "media" "generate-image prompt; generate-image-quality prompt - use the configured media provider and return IMAGE-GENERATED path=... artifact_id=...; in a hive it returns IMAGE-GENERATED sha256=... operation=.... In a hive a retry of the same prompt in the same task reuses that operation and never pays twice; for a deliberate new attempt start the prompt with op=<new-id>, an id of 8-120 letters, digits or . _ : -.")
